WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.780
Setup: blocks, shifts, stations, posts, and point people.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:17.570
Shifts go in named blocks, like Early, Late, or All day. Times are optional. Rename a block, or add its times once the schedule is out, and every shift in it changes at once.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.661
Pick a day, or add one with plus Day.

00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:29.450
Add a shift: pick a station or type a new one, then a block, or Times below for set times, then the spots and who can sign up.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:36.900
Below that, every station lists its posts, its point person, and its shifts, with Edit on each one.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:47.201
Edit changes the block or times, spots, who can sign up, how much it counts, and the status. If you move a set time, the families on it get an email.

00:00:47.401 --> 00:00:55.350
Who can sign up: anyone, H S and adults, H S students only, adults, or assigned by the coordinators.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.798
Posts split a station into jobs, like buses or directors. Add one with plus post. Then pick each person's post on the day grid.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:08.960
Plus point person adds the person running that station.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:19.380
All the point people are listed at the bottom. Email link sends them the link to their page. Homeroom coordinators placed on a shift show up here too.

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.880
Next: families.
